{"Several handlers call async deleteScheduledEmailReminder/deleteScheduledSMSReminder inside forEach without awaiting, so cancellations can be dropped when the request finishes (especially in serverless) and promise rejections won't be caught, resulting in reminders still being sent for cancelled/rescheduled bookings": 0.9457869529724121, "Reschedule flow cancels previous booking email reminders with immediateDelete=true, which bypasses the new deferred-cancellation (cancelled flag + cron) approach and is inconsistent with other reschedule/cancel paths, potentially leaving reminders active or reintroducing the cancellation-pressure pattern the PR aims to avoid": 0.8433473110198975, "The new cron cancellation query doesn't restrict to EMAIL reminders or non-null referenceId and then posts batch_id from reminder.referenceId which can be null, causing failed cancellations or attempts to cancel non-email reminders, with errors only being console.logged": 0.9620366096496582}